   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\n{x - 5y > 10}\\\\\n{2x + 3y >  - 2}\n\\end{array}} \\right.\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x - 5y > 10\"></span></td>\n<td>Substitute in the first inequality.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"6 - 5\\left( { - 3} \\right) > 10\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"6 + 15 > 10\"></span></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"23 > 10\"></span></td>\n<td>This is true.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"2x + 3y >  - 2\"></span></td>\n<td>Substitute in the second inequality.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"2\\left( 6 \\right) + 3\\left( { - 3} \\right) >  - 2\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"12 - 9 >  - 2\"></span></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"3 >  - 2\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>This is true. The ordered pair made both inequalities true. This is a solution to the system.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "a solution"
    }
   ],
